// 289's multiobj2, multiobj3 (and multiobj3_close) and multiobj4 ask which of
// two, three or four items, with no amount: 530's "Select an Option"
// dialogues with a model over each choice (140, 314, 554; void-634's
// dialogue_select2_models). The title is the caller's; 289's positions and
// captions' offsets have no place in them. 530's have no close button.

[proc,multiobj2](string $title, namedobj $obj1, int $x1, int $y1, int $scale1, string $string1, int $sx1, int $sy1, namedobj $obj2, int $x2, int $y2, int $scale2, string $string2, int $sx2, int $sy2)(namedobj)
